From dc28adf00c07843b3e6265d1c576dabbf34e574b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gareth jones <gareth@garethpaul.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:37:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] platform/apple: port gated J614s peripheral diagnostics
 without T8132 aliases

Reuse measured inherited USB2, gp1c trackpad reset and method-2 firmware ownership from f93. Preserve Gravity's T8132 ring transport unchanged and refuse that alias on J614s. Force J614s battery telemetry read-only. Refuse J614s ANS probing before power/MMIO: Gravity lacks the separately tested Aurora inherited-RTKit adoption path, so its existing generic NVMe reset route is not qualified for this board. Compile-only candidate; no hardware claim.
